---
// The evening of docs/produit.md, "Pour qui", told by the evening rather than by the child's faults: not knowing where to
// start, no one to help, or everyone tired; that organisation can be learned, docs/methode.md, "À retenir". One large
// column on the brand's light plane, its title at the size of a section title, its lines rising one after the other,
// from further down than elsewhere: the section's strong moment.
---

{/* Its bottom padding is the plane's fade (`--plane-fade`, 6rem then 8rem from lg), no more: the evening follows close. */}
<section class="plane-tint pt-28 pb-24 md:pt-32 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-32">
  {/* The column starts where the other sections' do (max-w-5xl); its lines keep their own measure. */}
  <play-once class="strong container block max-w-5xl">
    <h2 data-reveal="rise" class="section-title max-w-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground">
      <span class="highlighter">Rien n’a commencé</span> à 17&nbsp;h&nbsp;30
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-xl text-pretty text-foreground lg:mt-8 lg:text-2xl">
      <p data-reveal="rise" data-order="2">
        Votre enfant a des maths, de l’histoire et de l’anglais. Il tourne les pages et rien ne démarre. Personne n’est là pour l’aider. Ou bien tout
        le monde est fatigué et le ton monte.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal="rise" data-order="3">
        Parfois, le choix du premier devoir bloque. Cela s’apprend.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal="rise" data-order="4" class="font-bold text-primary">
        Tom aide votre enfant à s’organiser, un soir après l’autre.
      </p>
    </div>
  </play-once>
</section>

<style>
  .strong {
    --motion-distance: var(--motion-distance-strong);
  }
</style>
